This repository is a guide. It contains no firmware code. The firmware
projects and patches it refers to (Felucca, SLOOP and their forks, Snoop37
and its smk37-board patch series) are licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 3 (GPL-3.0) in their own repositories, and their licenses
apply to them. Short command lines and identifiers quoted in this guide may
be used freely.

